            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta il tipo di <code>letters</code> come array di stringhe.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"letters = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;b&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;c&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(letters);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;c&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>string</code>, seguito da <code>[</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
